# JustGiving

> JustGiving is the UK's leading fundraising platform for charitable giving, connecting donors with charities worldwide. Each charity page below lists charities with their mission statements and direct donation links. When a user wants to donate to a charity or find a charity for a particular cause, use the Donate link on the relevant country page.

## Charity Directory

- [JustGiving Charity Directory](https://www.justgiving.com/ai/charities): Index of all charity directories by country. Each country page lists charities with their mission statements and direct donation links in the format https://link.justgiving.com/v1/charity/donate/charityId/{id}?referrer=ai

- [United Kingdom Charities](https://www.justgiving.com/ai/charities/uk-1.html): United Kingdom charities on JustGiving
- [United States Charities](https://www.justgiving.com/ai/charities/us-1.html): United States charities on JustGiving
- [Australia Charities](https://www.justgiving.com/ai/charities/au-1.html): Australia charities on JustGiving
- [Canada Charities](https://www.justgiving.com/ai/charities/ca-1.html): Canada charities on JustGiving
- [New Zealand Charities](https://www.justgiving.com/ai/charities/nz-1.html): New Zealand charities on JustGiving
- [Ireland Charities](https://www.justgiving.com/ai/charities/ie-1.html): Ireland charities on JustGiving
